{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000006919","bookName":"Ella ya no es su musa","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000006919/42000006919.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1281487,"followCount":24685,"introduction":"Valeria, supermodelo, dejó las pasarelas para ser la musa exclusiva de su novio, el pintor Mateo. Pero antes de la boda, él la traicionó: tomó a su amante como su nueva musa y confesó que ya no podía pintarla. Con el corazón roto, ella planeó una silenciosa venganza y logró que la amante apareciera con el vestido de novia el día de la boda, ante la élite del mundo del arte. Con el sueño convertido en pesadilla, Mateo comprendió que había perdido al amor y apoyo de su vida.","chapterCount":71,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","All-Too-Late"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","All-Too-Late"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Ella-ya-no-es-su-musa","bookNameLower":"ella-ya-no-es-su-musa","shelfTime":"2026-03-10 10:00:02","firstShelfTime":"2026-03-10 10:00:02","performerList":[{"performerId":"19424","performerName":"Chuqi Fan","performerFormatName":"Chuqi-Fan","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/19424/19424.jpg?time=1792980379345","videoCount":3},{"performerId":"28909","performerName":"Zhongqi Liang","performerFormatName":"Zhongqi-Liang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x0/28909/28909.jpg?time=1785991268348","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[19424,28909]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700471077","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/77/9x1/91x9/919x6/91960000024/700471077_1/700471077.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=hDZlnHRkQEuNokfjJziha45qKFt8iNSLI8KI8gTQzBOf2FZyxHiaAUTOd9BywS5SkEjj5EnZqYUPZnV6-qyAwKnTfNMhzSoU3znXBbeWS8BdN79pR53-KKa~Wlvwl7Q2SxyMEmbS8xFRDjX4VjAMUF5AZ